  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Embassy in Kyiv supports  Kyiv School of Economics to become  a leading highest standard economic education institution on          Ukraine&apos;s road towards Europe and implementation of the EU-Ukraine    Association Agreement. The Agreement clearly specifies that at the    end of the three years period, there should be an evaluation. Its     results will be factored in to consult on further Swedish support.</narrative>
